    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About The Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game your main goal is to collect birch and earning xp to level up your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ways to upgrade your hero</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrading Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gaining level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skills to your axe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Magic spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero base is main place to upgrade your stats and gear. Here you can talk with some NPC and restore all of your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main place where you gather birch and fight some of enemies. Probably here you will spend most of your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game have few dungeons. Main goal of this dungeons is to get player better items. Every dungeon on the end have a boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join discord server to help improving game and talk with our community. Every one can suggest changes or new content to the game! In discord I post more information about the future of the game!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About The Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game your main goal is to collect birch and earning xp to level up your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ways to upgrade your hero</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrading Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gaining level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skills to your axe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Magic spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero base is main place to upgrade your stats and gear. Here you can talk with some NPC and restore all of your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main place where you gather birch and fight some of enemies. Probably here you will spend most of your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game have few dungeons. Main goal of this dungeons is to get player better items. Every dungeon on the end have a boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join discord server to help improving game and talk with our community. Every one can suggest changes or new content to the game! In discord I post more information about the future of the game!</p>",
